// Placeholder conversation exercising the proposed texting format (roadmap A1).
// All text is placeholder; it is not story content.

title: Mom_Spike_Start
---
<<declare $lied_to_mom = false>>
<<declare $ignored_mom = false>>
<<declare $mom_messages = 0>>
Mom: placeholder incoming one #delay:1.5
<<typing 0.2>>
Mom: placeholder incoming two
<<set $mom_messages = $mom_messages + 2>>
<<if ran_stop_sign()>>
    Mom: placeholder only shown when the stop sign was run
<<endif>>
-> Short label A
    Me: exact text for option a
    <<set $lied_to_mom to true>>
    <<jump Mom_Spike_A>>
-> Short label B
    Me: text for option b, line one
    Me: text for option b, line two
    <<jump Mom_Spike_B>>
-> Short label C <<if $mom_messages > 99>>
    Me: this option is never available
-> (no reply) #timeout:10
    <<set $ignored_mom to true>>
    <<jump Mom_Spike_Ignored>>
===

title: Mom_Spike_A
---
Mom: placeholder reply to a
===

title: Mom_Spike_B
---
Mom: placeholder reply to b
===

title: Mom_Spike_Ignored
---
Mom: placeholder reply to being ignored #delay:3
===

title: Mom_Spike_Followup
---
<<if $ignored_mom>>
    Mom: placeholder followup after being ignored
<<else>>
    Mom: placeholder followup after a reply
<<endif>>
===
